{"adr":"Decision: one in-browser booking service (lib/booking: injectable clock and storage, localStorage, Europe/London time via Intl) holds every rule. Screens reach it only through the generated lib/api client, which uses a local fetch adapter (lib/api-local) and makes no network calls.\nWhy: the spec bans a backend and requires PII to stay in the browser (NFR-12), while the factory requires contract-first access through the generated client. A local transport satisfies both, and tests still call the service directly (REQ-60).\nOrder of checks. Book: already_booked > cancelled_by_studio > class_started > outside_booking_window > class_full > overlap > booking_limit. Cancel/leave: status first (REQ-63), then started. Action state: studio-cancelled > started/ended ('Class has started') > booked > waitlisted > outside window > full > book.\nGaps closed: undo only works on a Booked record ≤5 s old and reduces the booked count by 1; corrupt or old-version storage is re-seeded, but a failed read shows Retry; promotion notices are kept in storage and consumed once; the 'Booked ✓'/'Waitlisted #N' card buttons open Class Detail; an unknown session gets 404 and an error state.\nNavigation: Schedule state (week, day, filters) and the Bookings tab live in URL search params, so Back restores them (REQ-44). At ≥1024 px Schedule shows Class Detail in a side panel through ?session=ID.","chosen":"OPT-A","complexity":"L","header":{"createdAt":"2026-10-06T23:29:21.984Z","inputsHash":"","kind":"plan","producedBy":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","stage":"plan"},"runId":"20261006-boutique-fitness-studio-class-b497","schemaVersion":1},"newDependencies":[],"options":[{"id":"OPT-A","simplest":false,"summary":"All rules live in one in-browser booking service module (lib/booking) persisted to localStorage. The client generated from contracts/openapi.yaml (lib/api) is configured with a local fetch adapter (lib/api-local) that routes each contract operation to the service in the same tab, so nothing goes over the network. Screen containers call only the generated client.","tradeoffs":"Meets the spec (no backend, NFR-12: no PII leaves the browser), the factory rule that the web app calls the API only through the generated client, and REQ-60 (tests call the service directly). Costs about 150 LOC of routing adapter. If an API repo is built later it can implement the same contract, and the web app only changes the fetch/baseUrl it is configured with."},{"id":"OPT-B","simplest":false,"summary":"An API repo implements the contract with a server and database, and the web app calls it over HTTP through the generated client.","tradeoffs":"This is the standard two-repo shape, but it breaks the approved spec: no backend (out of scope), localStorage persistence (REQ-4/5) and NFR-12 (no booking data in outbound requests). It also adds hosting and DB work that nobody approved."},{"id":"OPT-C","simplest":true,"summary":"Containers import the booking service directly. The OpenAPI file is documentation only.","tradeoffs":"Least code, but it breaks the factory rule that the web app calls the API only through lib/api. It also leaves screens tied to service internals, so the contract examples can't serve as the web app's test fixtures."}],"protectedPathsDeclared":["package.json"],"stubs":[{"content":"import type { BookingError } from \"./errors\";\n\nexport type ClassType = \"Yoga\" | \"Pilates\" | \"HIIT\" | \"Spin\" | \"Boxing\";\nexport type Intensity = \"Low\" | \"Medium\" | \"High\";\nexport type TimeOfDay = \"Morning\" | \"Afternoon\" | \"Evening\";\nexport type Room = \"Studio A\" | \"Studio B\" | \"Spin Room\";\nexport type SessionStatus = \"Scheduled\" | \"Cancelled by studio\";\nexport type BookingStatus = \"Booked\" | \"Waitlisted\" | \"Cancelled\" | \"Attended\" | \"Cancelled by studio\";\nexport type DurationMinutes = 30 | 45 | 60 | 75;\n\nexport interface Instructor {\n  id: number;\n  name: string;\n  initials: string;\n  bio: string;\n  avatarUrl: string;\n}\n\nexport interface WhatToBringItem {\n  title: string;\n  meta?: string;\n}\n\nexport interface Session {\n  id: number;\n  name: string;\n  type: ClassType;\n  intensity: Intensity;\n  instructorId: number;\n  room: Room;\n  /** UTC ISO instant */\n  startsAt: string;\n  durationMinutes: DurationMinutes;\n  capacity: number;\n  bookedCount: number;\n  waitlistCount: number;\n  description: string;\n  whatToBring: WhatToBringItem[];\n  status: SessionStatus;\n}\n\nexport type SkipReasonCode = \"overlap\" | \"booking_limit\" | \"outside_booking_window\";\n\nexport interface SkipReason {\n  code: SkipReasonCode;\n  message: string;\n}\n\nexport interface Booking {\n  id: number;\n  sessionId: number;\n  status: BookingStatus;\n  lateCancellation: boolean;\n  waitlistPosition: number | null;\n  skipReason: SkipReason | null;\n  /** UTC ISO instant */\n  createdAt: string;\n}\n\nexport interface Member {\n  id: number;\n  name: string;\n  initials: string;\n  membership: string;\n}\n\nexport interface PromotionNotice {\n  bookingId: number;\n  sessionId: number;\n  className: string;\n  startsAt: string;\n}\n\nexport interface SeedData {\n  member: Member;\n  instructors: Instructor[];\n  sessions: Session[];\n  bookings: Booking[];\n}\n\nexport interface PersistedState extends SeedData {\n  version: 1;\n  nextSessionId: number;\n  nextBookingId: number;\n  promotionNotices: PromotionNotice[];\n}\n\nexport interface ScheduleFilters {\n  types?: ClassType[];\n  intensities?: Intensity[];\n  timesOfDay?: TimeOfDay[];\n}\n\nexport type ActionState =\n  | { kind: \"book\"; spotsLeft: number }\n  | { kind: \"join_waitlist\"; position: number }\n  | { kind: \"booked\" }\n  | { kind: \"waitlisted\"; position: number; reason: SkipReason | null }\n  | { kind: \"disabled\"; reason: string };\n\nexport interface UpcomingGroup {\n  label: string;\n  date: string;\n  bookings: Booking[];\n}\n\nexport interface MyBookings {\n  upcoming: UpcomingGroup[];\n  past: Booking[];\n}\n\nexport interface Stats {\n  upcoming: number;\n  classesThisMonth: number;\n  currentStreakWeeks: number;\n}\n\nexport interface CalendarDay {\n  date: string;\n  label: string;\n  isToday: boolean;\n  sessionCount: number;\n}\n\nexport interface CalendarWeek {\n  weekStart: string;\n  label: string;\n  days: CalendarDay[];\n}\n\nexport interface ScheduleCalendar {\n  today: string;\n  weeks: CalendarWeek[];\n}\n\nexport type BookingOutcome =\n  | { ok: true; booking: Booking; session: Session }\n  | { ok: false; error: BookingError };\n\nexport type UndoOutcome =\n  | { ok: true; session: Session }\n  | { ok: false; error: BookingError };\n","path":"lib/booking/types.ts","reason":"Domain types used by the service API that unit tests call (REQ-60)."},{"content":"export type BookingErrorCode =\n  | \"already_booked\"\n  | \"class_full\"\n  | \"not_full\"\n  | \"outside_booking_window\"\n  | \"class_started\"\n  | \"cancelled_by_studio\"\n  | \"overlap\"\n  | \"booking_limit\"\n  | \"invalid_booking_state\"\n  | \"not_found\"\n  | \"storage_failure\";\n\nexport class BookingError extends Error {\n  readonly code: BookingErrorCode;\n\n  constructor(code: BookingErrorCode, message: string) {\n    super(message);\n    this.name = \"BookingError\";\n    this.code = code;\n  }\n}\n\n/** Default plain-language message for a code (never raw exception text). */\nexport function defaultMessage(code: BookingErrorCode): string {\n  throw new Error(\"not implemented\");\n}\n","path":"lib/booking/errors.ts","reason":"Error codes that tests assert (already booked, class full, outside booking window, etc.)."},{"content":"export const STUDIO_TIMEZONE = \"Europe/London\";\nexport const BOOKING_WINDOW_MINUTES = 7 * 24 * 60;\nexport const BOOKING_CUTOFF_MINUTES = 15;\nexport const FREE_CANCELLATION_MINUTES = 120;\nexport const MAX_UPCOMING_BOOKINGS = 10;\nexport const UNDO_WINDOW_MS = 5000;\nexport const STORAGE_KEY = \"pulse-studio:v1\";\nexport const MIN_SESSIONS_PER_WEEK = 20;\n","path":"lib/booking/config.ts","reason":"Studio rule thresholds shared by the service and tests."},{"content":"import type { TimeOfDay } from \"./types\";\n\n/** YYYY-MM-DD of the instant in Europe/London. */\nexport function londonDate(instant: Date): string {\n  throw new Error(\"not implemented\");\n}\n\n/** HH:mm (24-hour) in Europe/London. */\nexport function formatTime(instant: string | Date): string {\n  throw new Error(\"not implemented\");\n}\n\n/** \"HH:mm–HH:mm\" in Europe/London. */\nexport function formatTimeRange(startsAt: string | Date, durationMinutes: number): string {\n  throw new Error(\"not implemented\");\n}\n\n/** Short weekday in Europe/London, e.g. \"Mon\". */\nexport function weekdayShort(instant: string | Date): string {\n  throw new Error(\"not implemented\");\n}\n\n/** Day chip label for a London date, e.g. \"Mon 12\". */\nexport function dayChipLabel(date: string): string {\n  throw new Error(\"not implemented\");\n}\n\n/** \"Today\", \"Tomorrow\" or \"Thu 15 Oct\". */\nexport function dayGroupLabel(date: string, today: string): string {\n  throw new Error(\"not implemented\");\n}\n\n/** Monday (YYYY-MM-DD) of the week containing the date. */\nexport function weekStart(date: string): string {\n  throw new Error(\"not implemented\");\n}\n\nexport function addDays(date: string, days: number): string {\n  throw new Error(\"not implemented\");\n}\n\n/** Converts a London wall-clock date + \"HH:mm\" to a UTC ISO instant (DST-aware). */\nexport function londonWallTimeToUtc(date: string, hhmm: string): string {\n  throw new Error(\"not implemented\");\n}\n\n/** Morning < 12:00, Afternoon 12:00–16:59, Evening >= 17:00 (London). */\nexport function timeOfDay(instant: string | Date): TimeOfDay {\n  throw new Error(\"not implemented\");\n}\n","path":"lib/booking/time.ts","reason":"Europe/London date and time helpers that tests call (AC-2.1, AC-2.2)."},{"content":"import type { Session } from \"./types\";\n\nexport type AvailabilityInput = Pick<Session, \"capacity\" | \"bookedCount\" | \"waitlistCount\" | \"status\">;\n\n/** \"Cancelled\" | \"Full · N on waitlist\" | \"1 spot left\" | \"Only N left\" | \"N spots left\" */\nexport function availabilityLabel(session: AvailabilityInput): string {\n  throw new Error(\"not implemented\");\n}\n\n/** Accessible capacity text, e.g. \"6 of 20 spots left\". */\nexport function capacityLabel(session: AvailabilityInput): string {\n  throw new Error(\"not implemented\");\n}\n","path":"lib/booking/labels.ts","reason":"availabilityLabel is called directly by unit tests (AC-32.1, AC-32.2)."},{"content":"import type { ScheduleFilters, Session } from \"./types\";\n\n/** OR within a group, AND across groups, empty group matches all; sorted by start time; keeps studio-cancelled sessions. */\nexport function filterSessions(sessions: Session[], filters: ScheduleFilters): Session[] {\n  throw new Error(\"not implemented\");\n}\n","path":"lib/booking/filters.ts","reason":"filterSessions is called directly by unit tests (AC-34.x)."},{"content":"import type { Instructor, SeedData, Session } from \"./types\";\n\n/** Full seed for the current and next London week relative to now, plus Alex's records. */\nexport function generateSeed(now: Date): SeedData {\n  throw new Error(\"not implemented\");\n}\n\n/** At least 20 sessions for one Monday–Sunday week, ids starting at firstId; no bookings. */\nexport function generateWeekSessions(weekStart: string, firstId: number, instructors: Instructor[]): Session[] {\n  throw new Error(\"not implemented\");\n}\n","path":"lib/booking/seed.ts","reason":"The seed generator is called by unit tests (AC-3.x)."},{"content":"import type { PersistedState } from \"./types\";\n\nexport interface KeyValueStorage {\n  getItem(key: string): string | null;\n  setItem(key: string, value: string): void;\n  removeItem(key: string): void;\n}\n\nexport function createMemoryStorage(initial?: Record<string, string>): KeyValueStorage {\n  throw new Error(\"not implemented\");\n}\n\n/** null when absent, unparsable or another version; throws BookingError(\"storage_failure\") when reading fails. */\nexport function loadState(storage: KeyValueStorage): PersistedState | null {\n  throw new Error(\"not implemented\");\n}\n\n/** Throws BookingError(\"storage_failure\") when writing fails. */\nexport function saveState(storage: KeyValueStorage, state: PersistedState): void {\n  throw new Error(\"not implemented\");\n}\n","path":"lib/booking/storage.ts","reason":"Storage abstraction injected into the service by tests (AC-4.x, AC-5.1)."},{"content":"import type { KeyValueStorage } from \"./storage\";\nimport type {\n  ActionState,\n  Booking,\n  BookingOutcome,\n  Instructor,\n  Member,\n  MyBookings,\n  PromotionNotice,\n  ScheduleCalendar,\n  ScheduleFilters,\n  SeedData,\n  Session,\n  Stats,\n  UndoOutcome,\n} from \"./types\";\n\nexport interface Clock {\n  now(): Date;\n}\n\nexport const systemClock: Clock = { now: () => new Date() };\n\nexport type SessionRef = number | { id: number };\nexport type BookingRef = number | { id: number };\n\nexport interface BookingServiceOptions {\n  storage: KeyValueStorage;\n  clock?: Clock;\n  /** Used only when storage holds no valid data. */\n  seed?: SeedData | ((now: Date) => SeedData);\n}\n\nexport interface BookingService {\n  /** London date YYYY-MM-DD of the clock's now. */\n  today(): string;\n  getMember(): Member;\n  getInstructor(id: number): Instructor | undefined;\n  getSessions(): Session[];\n  getSession(ref: SessionRef): Session | undefined;\n  getCalendar(): ScheduleCalendar;\n  getSchedule(date: string, filters?: ScheduleFilters): Session[];\n  book(ref: SessionRef): BookingOutcome;\n  joinWaitlist(ref: SessionRef): BookingOutcome;\n  cancel(ref: BookingRef): BookingOutcome;\n  leaveWaitlist(ref: BookingRef): BookingOutcome;\n  undoBooking(ref: BookingRef): UndoOutcome;\n  isLateCancellation(ref: BookingRef): boolean;\n  /** All of Alex's records with derived status (Attended / Cancelled by studio). */\n  getBookings(): Booking[];\n  getMyBookings(): MyBookings;\n  getStats(): Stats;\n  getActionState(ref: SessionRef): ActionState;\n  consumePromotionNotices(): PromotionNotice[];\n  /** Test-only promotion hook (ASM-16). */\n  simulateOtherMemberCancellation(ref: SessionRef): void;\n}\n\n/** Loads stored data (or seeds it), rolls missing weeks forward, and returns the service. */\nexport function createBookingService(options: BookingServiceOptions): BookingService {\n  throw new Error(\"not implemented\");\n}\n","path":"lib/booking/service.ts","reason":"The booking service is the public module that unit tests call directly (REQ-60)."},{"content":"import type { BookingService } from \"../booking/service\";\n\nexport const LOCAL_API_BASE_URL = \"https://local.pulse-studio/api\";\n\n/** A fetch implementation that answers contract operations from the booking service without any network call. */\nexport function createLocalFetch(getService: () => BookingService): typeof fetch {\n  throw new Error(\"not implemented\");\n}\n","path":"lib/api-local/local-fetch.ts","reason":"In-browser transport for the generated lib/api client; tests may exercise contract routes through it."},{"content":"import type { BookingService } from \"../booking/service\";\n\n/** Idempotent: builds the singleton service over window.localStorage and points the generated client at the local fetch. */\nexport function configureLocalApi(): void {\n  throw new Error(\"not implemented\");\n}\n\nexport function getLocalBookingService(): BookingService {\n  throw new Error(\"not implemented\");\n}\n","path":"lib/api-local/setup.ts","reason":"Called by every container to wire the generated client to the local transport."},{"content":"openapi: 3.0.3\ninfo:\n  title: Pulse Studio Booking API\n  version: 1.0.0\n  description: >\n    Contract for the Pulse Studio class booking app (single member Alex Rivera).\n    In this release it is served in the browser by a local transport over the\n    booking service; no booking data leaves the browser. All times are\n    Europe/London; ids are integers.\nservers:\n  - url: https://local.pulse-studio/api\n    description: In-browser local transport (no network)\ntags:\n  - name: member\n  - name: schedule\n  - name: bookings\npaths:\n  /me:\n    get:\n      tags: [member]\n      operationId: getMember\n      summary: The signed-in demo member\n      responses:\n        '200':\n          description: Member profile\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                $ref: '#/components/schemas/Member'\n              example: {\"id\": 1, \"name\": \"Alex Rivera\", \"initials\": \"AR\", \"membership\": \"Unlimited Monthly\"}\n        '500':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/ServerError'\n  /me/stats:\n    get:\n      tags: [member]\n      operationId: getMyStats\n      summary: Upcoming, classes this month and current streak\n      responses:\n        '200':\n          description: Stats\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                $ref: '#/components/schemas/Stats'\n              example: {\"upcoming\": 2, \"classesThisMonth\": 3, \"currentStreakWeeks\": 3}\n        '500':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/ServerError'\n  /me/bookings:\n    get:\n      tags: [bookings]\n      operationId: listMyBookings\n      summary: Upcoming (grouped by day) and Past bookings\n      responses:\n        '200':\n          description: Alex's bookings\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                $ref: '#/components/schemas/MyBookings'\n              example:\n                upcoming:\n                  - label: Today\n                    date: '2026-10-14'\n                    bookings:\n                      - {\"id\": 101, \"sessionId\": 24, \"status\": \"Booked\", \"badge\": \"Booked\", \"lateCancellation\": false, \"lateIfCancelledNow\": false, \"waitlistPosition\": null, \"skipReason\": null, \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-10T18:02:11+01:00\", \"session\": {\"id\": 24, \"name\": \"Power Spin\", \"type\": \"Spin\", \"startsAt\": \"2026-10-14T19:00:00+01:00\", \"endsAt\": \"2026-10-14T19:45:00+01:00\", \"durationMinutes\": 45, \"room\": \"Spin Room\", \"instructorName\": \"Jordan Blake\"}}\n                  - label: Tomorrow\n                    date: '2026-10-15'\n                    bookings:\n                      - {\"id\": 102, \"sessionId\": 31, \"status\": \"Waitlisted\", \"badge\": \"Waitlisted #2\", \"lateCancellation\": false, \"lateIfCancelledNow\": false, \"waitlistPosition\": 2, \"skipReason\": null, \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-12T08:15:40+01:00\", \"session\": {\"id\": 31, \"name\": \"Vinyasa Flow\", \"type\": \"Yoga\", \"startsAt\": \"2026-10-15T07:00:00+01:00\", \"endsAt\": \"2026-10-15T08:00:00+01:00\", \"durationMinutes\": 60, \"room\": \"Studio A\", \"instructorName\": \"Maya Okafor\"}}\n                  - label: Fri 16 Oct\n                    date: '2026-10-16'\n                    bookings:\n                      - {\"id\": 103, \"sessionId\": 44, \"status\": \"Booked\", \"badge\": \"Booked\", \"lateCancellation\": false, \"lateIfCancelledNow\": false, \"waitlistPosition\": null, \"skipReason\": null, \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-13T12:40:05+01:00\", \"session\": {\"id\": 44, \"name\": \"Boxing Fundamentals\", \"type\": \"Boxing\", \"startsAt\": \"2026-10-16T18:15:00+01:00\", \"endsAt\": \"2026-10-16T19:15:00+01:00\", \"durationMinutes\": 60, \"room\": \"Studio B\", \"instructorName\": \"Marcus Cole\"}}\n                past:\n                  - {\"id\": 99, \"sessionId\": 12, \"status\": \"Cancelled\", \"badge\": \"Late cancel\", \"lateCancellation\": true, \"lateIfCancelledNow\": false, \"waitlistPosition\": null, \"skipReason\": null, \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-11T09:00:00+01:00\", \"session\": {\"id\": 12, \"name\": \"Reformer Core\", \"type\": \"Pilates\", \"startsAt\": \"2026-10-13T09:30:00+01:00\", \"endsAt\": \"2026-10-13T10:15:00+01:00\", \"durationMinutes\": 45, \"room\": \"Studio B\", \"instructorName\": \"Lena Fischer\"}}\n                  - {\"id\": 98, \"sessionId\": 7, \"status\": \"Attended\", \"badge\": \"Attended\", \"lateCancellation\": false, \"lateIfCancelledNow\": false, \"waitlistPosition\": null, \"skipReason\": null, \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T20:11:00+01:00\", \"session\": {\"id\": 7, \"name\": \"Sunrise Flow\", \"type\": \"Yoga\", \"startsAt\": \"2026-10-12T08:00:00+01:00\", \"endsAt\": \"2026-10-12T09:00:00+01:00\", \"durationMinutes\": 60, \"room\": \"Studio A\", \"instructorName\": \"Maya Okafor\"}}\n                  - {\"id\": 97, \"sessionId\": 3, \"status\": \"Attended\", \"badge\": \"Attended\", \"lateCancellation\": false, \"lateIfCancelledNow\": false, \"waitlistPosition\": null, \"skipReason\": null, \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-02T17:45:00+01:00\", \"session\": {\"id\": 3, \"name\": \"Rhythm Ride\", \"type\": \"Spin\", \"startsAt\": \"2026-10-07T17:30:00+01:00\", \"endsAt\": \"2026-10-07T18:15:00+01:00\", \"durationMinutes\": 45, \"room\": \"Spin Room\", \"instructorName\": \"Priya Nair\"}}\n                  - {\"id\": 96, \"sessionId\": 1, \"status\": \"Attended\", \"badge\": \"Attended\", \"lateCancellation\": false, \"lateIfCancelledNow\": false, \"waitlistPosition\": null, \"skipReason\": null, \"createdAt\": \"2026-09-28T07:30:00+01:00\", \"session\": {\"id\": 1, \"name\": \"HIIT Blast\", \"type\": \"HIIT\", \"startsAt\": \"2026-09-30T12:15:00+01:00\", \"endsAt\": \"2026-09-30T13:00:00+01:00\", \"durationMinutes\": 45, \"room\": \"Studio A\", \"instructorName\": \"Jordan Blake\"}}\n        '500':\n          $ref: '#/components/responses/ServerError'\n  /me/promotion-notices/consume:\n    post:\n      tags: [bookings]\n      operationId: consumePromotionNotices\n      summary: Returns waitlist promotions since the last visit and marks them shown (once)\n      responses:\n        '200':\n          description: Notices not yet shown (empty when none)\n          